# lab/directions-2/ is committed as the Lumen reference target until the
# adoption ends (docs/plans/2026-10-02-lumen-adoption.md). The rest of the design
# round stays local: third-party screenshots and captures, the research board
# that shows them, the direction that was not chosen, and the round's own stage,
# which the showcase stage (showcase/screens-stage.html) replaces.
